C     IF ELM=0 COMPUTE P                                                AT621080
   73 P=EXP(ALOG(PB)-(GO*EMOR)*((H-HB)/TMB))                            AT621090
      GO TO 90                                                          AT621100
C     Z GREATER THAN 90000.M FIND Z IN ZBTAB TABLE                      AT621110
